Full license: licenses/CC-BY-4.0.txt

The Noto animation files used by this package are not modified. The package
selects their playback frame and scales their display without rewriting the
source artwork. No endorsement by Google is implied.

Catalog metadata and optional assets are supplied by animated_emoji 3.3.0.
The remote fallback uses Google's mutable /latest/ endpoint. Catalog revision
and artwork revision are distinct; downloaded files expire after one day by
default. Applications requiring fully reproducible artwork should declare
selected assets from the pinned dependency instead of relying on remote files.

